flowchart TD
    T[Completed transactions] --> D[(Historical transaction data)]
    D --> F[Demand Forecasting]
    F --> P[Predicted demand by product<br/>time + day + context]
    P --> S[Compare predicted demand<br/>with current inventory]
    S --> R{Stockout / low-stock risk?}
    R -->|No| N[No action]
    R -->|Yes| A[Generate restock recommendation]
    P --> C{Cold-stock demand rising?}
    C -->|No| N2[No refrigeration action]
    C -->|Yes| H[Recommend moving stock<br/>into refrigeration]
    A --> SD[Staff Dashboard]
    H --> SD
    SD --> X[Staff action]
    X --> O[Outcome recorded]
    O --> D
